@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   物件設計
' chapter:      6-1
' realizes:     UC-04, UC-05, FR-14, FR-15, FR-16
' source:       backend/src/services/qa.service.js, backend/src/services/courseAccess.service.js, backend/src/services/faqCache.service.js, backend/src/services/answerGeneration.service.js（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-19
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依 fail-closed scope、FAQ、retrieval 與 supportingEvidenceIds 重繪
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title QA檢索回答與引用回傳循序圖

hide footbox
autonumber

participant "ConversationService" as Caller
participant "QaService" as QaService
participant "CourseAccessService" as AccessService
participant "BridgeScopeService" as ScopeService
participant "FaqCacheService" as FaqCache
participant "QueryEmbeddingService" as EmbeddingService
participant "Leaf／Hierarchy Retrieval" as Retrieval
participant "AnswerGenerationService" as AnswerService
database "Question／UsageLog models" as AuditModels

Caller -> QaService : askQuestion({ user, courseId, question,\nretrievalQuestion, history })
QaService -> QaService : assertQaRuntimeConfiguration()
QaService -> AccessService : assertCanAccessCourse(user, course)
QaService -> ScopeService : collectScopedVideos()\nbuildCourseSegmentScope()
ScopeService --> QaService : course／video allowlist
QaService -> FaqCache : findFaqByExactQuestion()

alt exact FAQ 命中且 evidence 仍在目前 scope
  FaqCache --> QaService : cached answer + marked evidence
  QaService -> AuditModels : recordUsage() + recordQuestion()
  QaService --> Caller : answer + citations + answerStatus + runtime
else exact miss／失效
  QaService -> EmbeddingService : embedQuery(standaloneQuestion)
  EmbeddingService --> QaService : queryVector
  QaService -> FaqCache : findFaqBySimilarEmbedding()
  alt semantic FAQ 命中且 evidence 有 provenance
    FaqCache --> QaService : cached answer + marked evidence
    QaService -> AuditModels : recordUsage() + recordQuestion()
    QaService --> Caller : answer + citations + faq_cache runtime
  else 正式檢索
    QaService -> Retrieval : Leaf baseline；依 rollout gate 選用 hierarchy\n限制 course／video allowlist
    Retrieval --> QaService : ranked matches + diagnostics
    alt 沒有可搜尋片段或相關命中
      QaService -> AuditModels : 記錄 NO_MATCH + runtime
      QaService --> Caller : 明確 no-answer + citations=[]
    else 有可用 evidence
      QaService -> AnswerService : generateAnswer(question, matches, history)
      AnswerService --> QaService : answer + supportingEvidenceIds
      QaService -> QaService : resolveSupportingMatches()\nbuildUserFacingCitations()
      QaService -> AuditModels : 記錄 UsageLog + Question
      opt 單輪、runtime ready 且不是 no-answer
        QaService -> FaqCache : saveFaqEntry(answer + supporting matches)
      end
      QaService --> Caller : answer + citations + answerStatus + runtime
    end
  end
end

note over QaService,AnswerService
  citations 只能由回答實際採用的 supportingEvidenceIds 升格；
  retrieval matches 不等於答案證據。Parent retrieval 只有 rollout gate 通過時才可影響 foreground。
end note

@enduml
